# Lectio supplement to lxx.vrs (mapping lines only, same "THIS = ORIGINAL" format).
# Lines here take precedence over lxx.vrs. Maintained by Lectio, not by SIL.
#
# lxx.vrs places the Prayer of Azariah and the Song of the Three inside Greek
# Daniel (DAG 3:24-90) but maps nothing onto org.vrs, where that material is
# the separate book S3Y. This is the same mapping vul.vrs gives for DAN.
DAG 3:24-90 = S3Y 1:1-67
